{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgoF6tQBsVP4AtuKdXbjc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added `free_slots` in `ledgerkit/slots.py` with tests in `tests/test_slots.py`, and committed both on `crew/1107-10d03b` as 33c6266. `python3 -m pytest -q` gives 12 passed, which covers the 11 new slot tests and the existing money test file. I haven't pushed anything.\n\nThe tests cover these cases:\n- unsorted and overlapping busy intervals\n- touching intervals, which leave no zero-length gap\n- clipping to the window, and intervals entirely outside it\n- the `min_minutes` filter\n- zero-length busy intervals\n- mixed UTC offsets, with output in `day_start`'s timezone\n- every `ValueError` case\n\nOne behaviour to be aware of: busy intervals are validated even when they fall outside the window. A naive datetime or an interval with `end < start` raises `ValueError` regardless of where it sits."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":207,"cache_read_input_tokens":34750,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":207},"output_tokens":298,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2f43ceb1-fcc1-40b4-9122-7e288507cb29","uuid":"5a7b46b1-4b37-4b72-ba42-3682770df5e2","timestamp":"2026-11-07T08:22:10.967Z","request_id":"req_011CgoF6tF1v9NFibpoTNZTK"}
